dicate pull up a  chair to the high table while 2014's  John wick was a straight-up revenge  flick the 2017 sequel fleshed out the  mysterious world of professional killers  considerably revealing the existence of  an all-powerful Council of assassins and  crime lords known as the high table  kimonos double Santino's open contract  has gone international a table according  to Kolstad in one of the early script  drafts we went in depth on what the high  table is until we realized it was too  much for one story  luckily coal studs interview seemed to  indicate that chapter 3 will finally go  for it which was then confirmed by the  director Reeves also teased the high  tables involvement in chapter 3 during  an interview with Empire saying maybe  the high table shows up and then the  high table starts firing guns and then  maybe this kind of thing starts to  happen between the high table and  continental  wouldn't that be awesome John wick the  end as it stands John week chapter 3  will be the last movie that will focus  on Reeves character at least as far as  the filmmakers are concerned asked by  the independent if he saw the third  chapter as the final one Chad still s  keys answer was yes although he left the  final decision in the hands of Lionsgate  it seems like there's a slim chance  Reeves could return in a fourth film but  it's more likely that the studio is  planning on doing more John wick movies  without the character according to The  Hollywood Reporter Lionsgate has already  purchased a screenplay called ballerina  described as Luke Vasant meets Quentin  Tarantino  with the intention of releasing it as a  John wick spin-off there's been little  news of the project since which suggests  that Lionsgate intend to see the John  wick trilogy out before expanding the  universe that doesn't mean that Keanu  Reeves will never play the character  again though in January 2018  stars the television network owned by  Lionsgate confirmed that it was  developing a TV 